  <item>
    <title>Vol. 57 I 今日朋友说 I 微小波点，通往无限 ♾️ I 纪念草间弥生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a901c6a1352af56ff3d00b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a901c6a1352af56ff3d00b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>谢谢你, 我的波点女王。愿你在天堂不再有苦痛。</span></p><p><strong><span>📝 本期简介</span></strong></p><p><span>♾️ 草间弥生的不平凡的童年与人生经验：死亡新闻-内心宇宙-自我消融</span><br><span>♾️ 艺术与象征：波点、南瓜与恐惧的转化</span><br><span>♾️ 下辈子还想当艺术家</span></p><p><span>🪧</span><strong><span> SHOWNOTES</span></strong></p><p><span>🟢 Part 1 悼念草间弥生，介绍波点艺术的思想起源与草间弥生的成长经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>&nbsp;97岁草间弥生去世，20年纪录片记录艺术传奇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a>&nbsp;众人看到病痛折磨，她用痛苦谱出希望乐章</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a>&nbsp;童年满是家庭混乱，母亲责备与孤独让她与世界格格不入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a>&nbsp;圆点为语言，画布成世界，开启艺术家心灵探险</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a>&nbsp;画波点平息内心恐惧，艺术是她的救命稻草</span></p><p><span>🟢 Part 2 解析草间弥生标志性创作南瓜的意象，解读背后的象征意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a>&nbsp;会说话的南瓜是最温柔的幻觉，治愈孤独心灵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a>&nbsp;南瓜的独特性，投射她在封闭社会特立独行的自我认同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a>&nbsp;创作南瓜，是为了向全人类传递和平与爱的信息</span></p><p><span>🟢 Part 3 分享草间弥生半个世纪带病创作的不凡人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a>&nbsp;在精神疗养院居住半世纪，医院就是家，创作不受限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a>&nbsp;创作是生命，她要画到甚至400岁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a>&nbsp;自认使命是用艺术拯救全人类，听起来自大却是真实人生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a>&nbsp;在痛苦中创作，展现强大真实的力量，令人难以抗拒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a>&nbsp;把恐惧变成全世界追捧的美，堪称艺术史最棒的魔法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a>&nbsp;恐惧焦虑不会消失，重点是你要把它们转化成什么力量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a>&nbsp;波点是通向无限的秘密，微小却强大，小事也能成就大未来</span></p><p><span>🎃 </span><strong><span>相关推荐</span></strong></p><p><span>《Yayoi Kusama, I Love me》(2008)</span></p><p><span>《Kusama : infinity》(2018)</span></p><p><span>《无限的网：草间弥生自传》</span></p><p><span>《草间弥生艺术全记录》</span></p><p><span>🙋‍♀️</span><strong><span> 还有哪里可以找到台北雅</span></strong></p><p><span>💚 TySyLuv37 &nbsp;&nbsp;🍠 </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/218ZCLzLabS" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/218ZCLzLabS"><strong><span>没关系是台北雅啊</span></strong></a><span> 🦋 TY一点也不歪</span></p><p><span>👇</span><strong><span> 欢迎加入好聊、好玩、好动也很好学</span></strong><span>📚</span><strong><span>的听友群</span></strong><span>👇</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlbYPfQI5L71w1-VkH1kzsOdE5Jx.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
