  <item>
    <title>Vol. 49 I 金三银四双城求职记 I 二本生VS大龄返场打工人突出重围血泪史(内附避坑指南📖)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d4ef8fb977fb2c4751d112</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d4ef8fb977fb2c4751d112</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🎤 节目简介</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>借着“金三银四”求职季, 台北雅特别策划了一系列两岸职场观察实录，本期作为开篇之作。台北雅与在香港写代码的二本CPA - 新晋🍠职场博主</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/iCr1nX62sN" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/iCr1nX62sN"><span>港漂舒舒</span></a><span>将浅浅地拆解关于二本学历、大龄求职与面试潜规则。希望能够给正在求职的听友们一些收获/帮助避坑😉</span></p><span></span><p><span>👯‍♀️</span><strong><span> 本期嘉宾</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在香港写代码的二本CPA-新晋🍠职场博主</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/iCr1nX62sN" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/iCr1nX62sN"><span>港漂舒舒</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🪧</span><strong><span> Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🟢 Part 1 两岸求职两三事：地域差异、产业风向与隐形规则</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 冷知识：台湾没有「金三银四」，年后才是真正的求职旺季！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> 浅浅地比较两岸就业市场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 那些看不见的天花板 : 你的求职路被什么限制了？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 学历的黄金权重：985/211是敲门金砖，决定起跑点?</span><br><span></span><br><span>🟢 </span><strong><span>Part 2 求职技术流：简历、面试与渠道心法</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 简历筛选的「算法」：AI与关键词很无情，但可能错过真正的潜力股</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 简历优化实战：在世俗标准与个性表达之间，找到你的平衡点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> Overqualified的悖论：太优秀也是问题？雇主可能只想找个「稳定的小伙伴」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> 跨城求职法则：放下原有光环，当个「小透明」，重新适应游戏规则</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 招聘新阵地：社媒成了招聘新宠，外企也在这里「淘」人才</span><br><span></span><br><span>🟢 </span><strong><span>Part 3 面试奇遇与避坑指南：偏见、陷阱与及时止损</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> 面试中的偏见：女性被问婚姻计划？职场隐形歧视何时休</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a> 面试「送命题」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2298">38:18</a> 警惕「画大饼」：职位描述天花乱坠，入职后发现是「买家秀」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 奇葩经历实录：老板让我免费提前上班两天，这操作你见过吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">42:28</a> 相信自己的直觉：入职当天就感觉是个坑，果断跑路是种能力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 合同的定心丸：在台湾，白纸黑字的合同是保障权益的第一步</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>🟢</span><strong><span> 结语：求职如同相亲, 是一场双向选择与自我掌控</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>评</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>论区分享你遇到过哪些奇葩面试经历, 或者分享自己对于两岸职场文化差异的体会, 又或者可以给正在找工作的自己/他人留一句“打气的话”。言出必行台北雅将选取二位“走心听众”送出神秘小礼物🎁哦</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🔍 节目中提到的一些求职渠道</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👩‍🏫</span><strong><span>台北雅推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1111人力银行/518人力/Yes123/Yourator/CakeResume/iThome/Meet.jobs/Meet.jobs</span></p><span></span><p><span>Facebook 社团/DCard/企业官网/social media</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👩‍🏫港漂舒舒推荐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>BOSS直聘/前程无忧 (51job)/智联招聘/拉勾网/猎聘/脉脉/领英/社媒/企业官网...</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🙋‍♀️ 还有哪里可以找到台北雅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>💚 TySyLuv37 &nbsp;&nbsp;🍠 </span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/218ZCLzLabS" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/218ZCLzLabS"><span>没关系是台北雅啊</span></a><span> &nbsp;🦋 TY一点也不歪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👇 欢迎加入《我有个朋友说啥都好》听友群👇</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWX1OKokFaj7uLQt0FRHVliKaeV.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
