    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👯‍♀️ </span><strong><span>特此感谢</span></strong><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/80FDBNUr4Nv" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/80FDBNUr4Nv"><strong><span>善谈蜡烛</span></strong></a><strong><span>邀请出席《非穷尽列举》妇女节特映活动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>👯‍♀️ 标题灵感来源可搓👉</span><a href="https://www.sohu.com/a/995147219_318740" data-url="https://www.sohu.com/a/995147219_318740"><strong><span>裴淳华专访新闻</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>🌹 </span><strong><span>节目简介</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>能够把这么严肃、引发各种热议探讨的《非穷尽列举》聊得如此“肤浅”、松弛, 估计也只有《我有个朋友说》做得到吧...哈哈哈 (这有什么好得意的?)</span></p><span></span><p><span>🪧</span><strong><span> 本期不列Shownote只是想讲讲自己的一些思考</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>1. 面试必问婚姻状况，职场对女性到底有多少隐形偏见？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 从三从四德到职场女强人，现代女性为何需要成为「全能选手」？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 该死的母性让我们总是却于say no？聊聊女性互助与自我接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.性教育妈妈讲，爸爸甩锅？女性总是自我反省</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 想哭就哭想躺平就躺平，接受不完美的自己有多难？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Ojos Tristes》 by Selena Gomez / Benny Blanco / The Marias</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙋‍♀️ </span><strong><span>还有哪里可以找到台北雅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>💚 TySyLuv37 &nbsp;&nbsp;🍠</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/2s7TdG7bi00" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/2s7TdG7bi00"><span> 没关系是台北雅啊</span></a><span> &nbsp;🦋 TY一点也不歪</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span><strong><span> 欢迎加入《我有个朋友说啥都好》听友群</span></strong><span>👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKYHtgBrfPkyuG-_POQYfihwEUC.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
